{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965680/extras/48712e756deba7009450cce148d10e0a.poster.avif?t=1767499148\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965680/extras/48712e756deba7009450cce148d10e0a.webm?t=1767499148\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965680/extras/48712e756deba7009450cce148d10e0a.mp4?t=1767499148\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965680/extras/5b988defca74e53c3c8cfe4ebdac062e.poster.avif?t=1767499148\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965680/extras/5b988defca74e53c3c8cfe4ebdac062e.webm?t=1767499148\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965680/extras/5b988defca74e53c3c8cfe4ebdac062e.mp4?t=1767499148\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dear Players,</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Dunkenwood House\u2014your new school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Arenda Finch. After being expelled from your church-run girls\u2019 school for speaking too many blasphemous words, you have been transferred here. To adjust to your new life, it helps to remember a few rules:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are not a detective.</strong><br>Your task is simply to study, repair your relationship with your brother, graduate, and inherit the fortune left to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this manor has a long and intricate history. Strange things happen here, and strange people live here. Conspiracies, crimes, and malevolent individuals may well exist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will face choices\u2014some that save you from immediate danger, and others that shape the person you become.<br>If life at school grows dull, you may look further into the house\u2019s past, your family\u2019s secrets, and the darkness surrounding those you meet.<br>But the truth never comes without a price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck.<br>Your new life begins here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Our Discord community :</strong></i></u>\u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965680/extras/d54eb83b62dcf8bcfacd01096305723f.poster.avif?t=1767499148\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965680/extras/d54eb83b62dcf8bcfacd01096305723f.webm?t=1767499148\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965680/extras/d54eb83b62dcf8bcfacd01096305723f.mp4?t=1767499148\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Demon\u2019s Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a detective story.<br>There are conspiracies, crimes, and those who wish you harm.<br>But when the inhuman intervenes, do not attempt to understand it through human logic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Choice Between Life and Death</strong><br>Some decisions alter your immediate circumstances.<br>Others shape your future.<br>All of them matter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forbidden Love</strong><br>To love someone you should not.<br>To protect the people you care for, or sacrifice them for something greater.<br>If they truly love you, shouldn't they be willing to give everything\u2014even their lives?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And then\u2014</strong><br>???<br>Uncover the concealed truths behind the main narrative and the unspoken secrets of the others around you.<br>But truth demands payment.<br>You may have to die more than once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965680/extras/001976e8d03a52fe4ab05cad527071fb.poster.avif?t=1767499148\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965680/extras/001976e8d03a52fe4ab05cad527071fb.webm?t=1767499148\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965680/extras/001976e8d03a52fe4ab05cad527071fb.mp4?t=1767499148\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"New Term","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2965680/02278a3d00a50e7915c5793bd90fc9aa56b1a20f.jpg"},{"name":"Oops","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2965680/a69bfdcaddb83823e15987581cc7433d9385ed38.jpg"},{"name":"Finished Chapter I","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2965680/6313db28bc2f6660ea3e9ef8e1a3569c74e3b6ed.jpg"},{"name":"Endless Stairs","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2965680/ae50e951d692283b4e9fe8c83f32d11db178a45e.jpg"},{"name":"7th Circle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2965680/7bc51618fb0256b070a04bc3dd280a2822217223.jpg"},{"name":"Brother Knows Best","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2965680/0a60aa737152737bc5ec68566286db4529860a52.jpg"},{"name":"Broken Watch","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2965680/6d72828376f958bbcb15d5eb7981c26d4f6f4e47.jpg"},{"name":"Your Duty","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2965680/5752da205f88f3dca09c6f8579e7b890b4b63fa2.jpg"},{"name":"Finished Chapter II","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2965680/98a6feaea46b5c9f5f187e0f0dfc137971c5c5c5.jpg"},{"name":"The Nun","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2965680/6de0342069abb452a405ff53b8d272018f8b463c.jpg"}],"total":31},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2965680?t=1767499148","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965680/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767499148","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965680/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767499148","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965680/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767499148","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965680/extras/48712e756deba7009450cce148d10e0a.poster.avif?t=1767499148\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965680/extras/48712e756deba7009450cce148d10e0a.webm?t=1767499148\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965680/extras/48712e756deba7009450cce148d10e0a.mp4?t=1767499148\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965680/extras/5b988defca74e53c3c8cfe4ebdac062e.poster.avif?t=1767499148\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965680/extras/5b988defca74e53c3c8cfe4ebdac062e.webm?t=1767499148\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965680/extras/5b988defca74e53c3c8cfe4ebdac062e.mp4?t=1767499148\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dear Players,</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Dunkenwood House\u2014your new school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Arenda Finch. After being expelled from your church-run girls\u2019 school for speaking too many blasphemous words, you have been transferred here. To adjust to your new life, it helps to remember a few rules:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are not a detective.</strong><br>Your task is simply to study, repair your relationship with your brother, graduate, and inherit the fortune left to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this manor has a long and intricate history. Strange things happen here, and strange people live here. Conspiracies, crimes, and malevolent individuals may well exist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will face choices\u2014some that save you from immediate danger, and others that shape the person you become.<br>If life at school grows dull, you may look further into the house\u2019s past, your family\u2019s secrets, and the darkness surrounding those you meet.<br>But the truth never comes without a price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck.<br>Your new life begins here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Our Discord community :</strong></i></u>\u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965680/extras/d54eb83b62dcf8bcfacd01096305723f.poster.avif?t=1767499148\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965680/extras/d54eb83b62dcf8bcfacd01096305723f.webm?t=1767499148\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965680/extras/d54eb83b62dcf8bcfacd01096305723f.mp4?t=1767499148\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Demon\u2019s Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a detective story.<br>There are conspiracies, crimes, and those who wish you harm.<br>But when the inhuman intervenes, do not attempt to understand it through human logic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Choice Between Life and Death</strong><br>Some decisions alter your immediate circumstances.<br>Others shape your future.<br>All of them matter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forbidden Love</strong><br>To love someone you should not.<br>To protect the people you care for, or sacrifice them for something greater.<br>If they truly love you, shouldn't they be willing to give everything\u2014even their lives?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And then\u2014</strong><br>???<br>Uncover the concealed truths behind the main narrative and the unspoken secrets of the others around you.<br>But truth demands payment.<br>You may have to die more than once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965680/extras/001976e8d03a52fe4ab05cad527071fb.poster.avif?t=1767499148\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965680/extras/001976e8d03a52fe4ab05cad527071fb.webm?t=1767499148\" type=\"vid